Here's the structured goal model for the multi-robot system mission:

### Goal Model Summary

| Goal ID | Title | Text | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation | Justification |
|--------|-------|------|--------------------|-----------|----------|---------------|
| G1     | Ensure Food Delivery and Dish Retrieval | Ensure food is delivered and dishes are retrieved. | ; (sequential) | Achieve | - | Ensures both delivery and retrieval are completed. |
| G2     | Deliver Food | Deliver food to inpatient rooms. | ; (sequential) | Perform | G1 -> G2 (AND) | Essential for patient care. |
| G3     | Retrieve Dishes | Retrieve dirty dishes from rooms. | ; (sequential) | Perform | G1 -> G3 (AND) | Necessary for hygiene. |
| G4     | Manage Door Access | Ensure doors are opened appropriately. | ; (sequential) | Perform | G1 -> G4 (AND) | Required for robot access. |
| G2.1   | Direct Delivery by Robot | Deliver food directly using robotic skills. | - | Perform | G2 -> G2.1 (OR) | Direct delivery is a method. |
| G2.2   | Tray Delivery with Cooperation | Deliver food via tray with human or robot help. | - | Perform | G2 -> G2.2 (OR) | Alternative method. |
| G2.3   | Track and Alert | Track meal retrieval and alert if wrong meal taken. | - | Perform | G2 -> G2.3 (AND) | Ensures correct meals are delivered. |
| G3.1   | Unassisted Dish Retrieval | Retrieve dishes without assistance. | - | Perform | G3 -> G3.1 (OR) | Possible method. |
| G3.2   | Assisted Dish Retrieval | Retrieve dishes with assistance. | - | Perform | G3 -> G3.2 (OR) | Alternative method. |
| G4.1   | Robot-Operated Door Opening | Open doors using robots. | - | Perform | G4 -> G4.1 (OR) | Autonomous access. |
| G4.2   | Human-Assisted Door Opening | Open doors with human help. | - | Perform | G4 -> G4.2 (OR) | Backup method. |

### Task Model Summary

| Task ID | Title | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots | Justification |
